WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.269
Google Will Make

00:00:01.128 --> 00:00:02.295
AI Agents Use

00:00:02.107 --> 00:00:03.498
Its MCP Servers

00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:05.134
Google is moving

00:00:04.946 --> 00:00:06.219
its Workspace AI

00:00:06.031 --> 00:00:07.115
agents onto its

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:08.554
own MCP servers

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:09.509
with one catch

00:00:09.746 --> 00:00:10.971
the Gmail agent

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:12.033
can't send email

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.142
On 24 November

00:00:14.354 --> 00:00:15.203
Google made its

00:00:15.144 --> 00:00:16.712
eight Workspace MCP

00:00:16.524 --> 00:00:18.375
servers generally available

00:00:18.222 --> 00:00:19.224
and published a

00:00:19.036 --> 00:00:20.050
new clause in

00:00:19.861 --> 00:00:21.217
its API terms

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:24.292
From 1 February 2027

00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:25.377
any tool that

00:00:25.248 --> 00:00:26.132
is or is

00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:26.769
driven by an

00:00:26.616 --> 00:00:27.606
AI Agent

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:29.080
must reach Gmail

00:00:29.151 --> 00:00:29.835
Drive

00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:31.050
Calendar and the

00:00:30.861 --> 00:00:32.028
rest of Workspace

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:32.984
through those servers

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.524
Full story on

00:00:34.335 --> 00:00:35.231
the dashboard
